  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5268,
      "text": "Maka ketika mereka melihat azab (pada hari Kiamat) sudah dekat, wajah orang-orang kafir itu menjadi muram. Dan dikatakan (kepada mereka), \"Inilah (azab) yang dahulu kamu memintanya.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5269,
      "text": "Katakanlah (Muhammad), \"Tahukah kamu jika Allah mematikan aku dan orang-orang yang bersamaku atau memberi rahmat kepada kami, (maka kami akan masuk surga), lalu siapa yang dapat melindungi orang-orang kafir dari azab yang pedih?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5270,
      "text": "Katakanlah, \"Dialah Yang Maha Pengasih, kami beriman kepada-Nya dan kepada-Nya kami bertawakal. Maka kelak kamu akan tahu siapa yang berada dalam kesesatan yang nyata.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5271,
      "text": "Katakanlah (Muhammad), \"Terangkanlah kepadaku jika sumber air kamu menjadi kering; maka siapa yang akan memberimu air yang mengalir?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5272,
      "text": "Nūn. Demi pena dan apa yang mereka tuliskan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5273,
      "text": "dengan karunia Tuhanmu engkau (Muhammad) bukanlah orang gila.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5274,
      "text": "Dan sesungguhnya engkau pasti mendapat pahala yang besar yang tidak putus-putusnya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5275,
      "text": "Dan sesungguhnya engkau benar-benar, berbudi pekerti yang luhur.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5276,
      "text": "Maka kelak engkau akan melihat dan mereka (orang-orang kafir) pun akan melihat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5277,
      "text": "siapa di antara kamu yang gila?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5278,
      "text": "Sungguh, Tuhanmu, Dialah yang paling mengetahui siapa yang sesat dari jalan-Nya; dan Dialah yang paling mengetahui siapa orang yang mendapat petunjuk.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5279,
      "text": "Maka janganlah engkau patuhi orang-orang yang mendustakan (ayat-ayat Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5280,
      "text": "Mereka menginginkan agar engkau bersikap lunak maka mereka bersikap lunak (pula).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5281,
      "text": "Dan janganlah engkau patuhi setiap orang yang suka bersumpah dan suka menghina,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5282,
      "text": "suka mencela, yang kian ke mari menyebarkan fitnah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5283,
      "text": "yang merintangi segala yang baik, yang melampaui batas dan banyak dosa,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5284,
      "text": "yang bertabiat kasar, selain itu juga terkenal kejahatannya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5285,
      "text": "karena dia kaya dan banyak anak.[845]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5286,
      "text": "Apabila ayat-ayat Kami dibacakan kepadanya, dia berkata, \"(Ini adalah) dongeng-dongeng orang dahulu.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
